{"resource":"lines/hs-guidance-counselor","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":12,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy24-approved-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy24-approved-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"573781c9c362302f6849bb414dc0461cf067380859f8ce1b3491f67479de71dd","cited_as":"fy24-approved-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy26-school-dept-approved-budget-3-12-25.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy26-school-dept-approved-budget-3-12-25.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"ec60d43ffd8dbd011fd9b650e36d59c0910a5af53aad5c0935fcad2848323b1f","cited_as":"fy26-school-dept-approved-budget-3-12-25.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-24-26-with-restorations.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-24-26-with-restorations.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"64140f25cbe0f0c38fafeaeeed2326c4dca980c46e3063cd97f304affdfd3357","cited_as":"fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-24-26-with-restorations.txt"}],"count":3},"rows":[{"line_key":"hs guidance counselor","label":"H.S. Guidance Counselor","fy":2